{
  "id": "pilot-evaluation-agreement",
  "version": "1.0.0",
  "name": "Pilot and Evaluation Agreement",
  "description": "A short agreement under which a customer tries a product before buying it — a pilot, proof of concept, evaluation or beta test. The checks read for a license confined to evaluation, a stated length, what happens when the pilot ends, rights in feedback, return or deletion of data, and an as-is disclaimer. Distinct from `saas-customer`, which reads the paid subscription a pilot may convert into.",
